\">-33.8688 / 151.2093</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-lock\">SIGNAL LOCKED</span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"underworld\" class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-stele\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-kicker\">UNDERWORLD ARCHIVE / FORGE 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-seal\"><i></i><i></i><b>V</b></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-oath\">TRIED BELOW · RETURNED WHOLE</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-cuts\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"astral\" class=\"cstd-deep-astral-compass\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-kicker\">ASTRAL JOURNAL / ROLL 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-die\"><i></i><b>20</b><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-route\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-oath\">CHOICE INKED · LEGACY CARRIED</span></div></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1540px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><p data-cstd-page-hero-eyebrow=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">01 / SHIPPED SYSTEMS</p><h1 data-cstd-page-hero-title=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 text-balance text-[2.375rem] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[0] text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.9] lg:text-8xl xl:text-[7rem]\">Work is not a screenshot. It is a chain of explainable decisions.</h1><p data-cstd-page-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#c3c9cb] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">Six cases span content products, AI research, creative tooling, operational systems, deterministic computation, and portrait services. Each records constraints, architecture, evidence, and lessons.</p></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->SCROLL / CONTINUE TRACE</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c]/88\"><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">01</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">Evidence pipeline / decision workspace</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">CSTD Alpha research system</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">A research workflow instead of a one-shot report: sources, background jobs, valuation versions, and disconfirming conditions stay with each result.</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">ROLE</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Product, full stack, data pipeline, and AI orchestration</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">STATUS</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Private production system<!-- --> · <!-- -->112<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-alpha-research-system\"><img alt=\"CSTD Alpha research interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 24%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->ALPHA</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/en/work/cfzzs-crm\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">02</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">Operations / permissions and concurrency</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">CFZZS industrial CRM</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">A lead workbench for an industrial-park team, keeping deduplication, stage changes, spatial inventory, and exports tied to traceable state.</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">ROLE</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Requirements, full stack, and production acceptance</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">STATUS</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Live<!-- --> · <!-- -->102<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-cfzzs-crm\"><img alt=\"CFZZS CRM dashboard\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 26%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/crm.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->CRM</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/en/work/creative-workbench\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">03</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">Generative media / private workflow</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">CSTD Design creative workbench</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">A private Chinese workbench where conversations branch, image and video jobs can recover, and every asset keeps its source.</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">ROLE</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Product, interaction, full stack, and security</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">STATUS</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Private production system<!-- --> · <!-- -->100<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-creative-workbench\"><img alt=\"CSTD Design creative workbench\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 20%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/design.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->DESIGN</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/en/work/dcf-quantum\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">04</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">Deterministic finance / local software</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">DCF Quantum</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">A local three-scenario DCF screener that keeps data definitions, caching, run manifests, and Windows delivery in one research flow.</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">ROLE</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Product, Python core, performance, and desktop delivery</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">STATUS</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Local release<!-- --> · <!-- -->108<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-dcf-quantum\"><img alt=\"Deterministic finance data chamber\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-data-vault-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->DCF</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/en/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">05</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">Open-data analysis / reproducible R pipeline</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">Melbourne Pedestrians × Microclimate</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">Three official City of Melbourne open datasets, cleaned, spatially joined, and modelled into one reproducible pipeline: 1.47 million pedestrian records meet the microclimate under a 150-metre matching rule.</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">ROLE</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">End to end: question design, wrangling, spatial joins, modelling, visualisation, and reporting</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">STATUS</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">Reproducible analysis pipeline<!-- --> · <!-- -->102<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><img alt=\"Weekday-by-hour heatmap of pedestrian activity across the Melbourne CBD\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-melbourne-heatmap-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->MELBOURNE-OPEN-DATA</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-ins